{"ref":"BDB, כֶּ֫סֶל","hw":"כֶּ֫סֶל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּ֫סֶל</span></big>  <strong>n.m. 1.loins</strong>, <strong>2. stupidity</strong>, <strong>3. confidence (</strong>NH <em>id. loin;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּסְלָא</span> <em>id.</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>loins</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּ֑סֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 15:27\" href=\"/Job.15.27\">Jb 15:27</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּסָלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.4\">Lv 3:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.9\">4:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.4\">7:4</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּסָלַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:8\" href=\"/Psalms.38.8\">ψ 38:8</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>stupidity, folly</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:25\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.25\">Ec 7:25</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">סִכְלוּת</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">כֵּסֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:14\" href=\"/Psalms.49.14\">ψ 49:14</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>confidence</em>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּסְלִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 31:24\" href=\"/Job.31.24\">Jb 31:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּסְלֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.26\">Pr 3:26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּסְלוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 8:14\" href=\"/Job.8.14\">Jb 8:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּסְלָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:7\" href=\"/Psalms.78.7\">ψ 78:7</a>.","next":"BDB, כִּסְלָה","prev":"BDB, כָּסַל"}